34
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:54,950
demonstrates judgment better than drawing every distributed component from the beginning. Define service-level indicators for latency, availability, correctness,

35
00:09:55,000 --> 00:10:12,450
freshness, and backlog. Alert on user impact and exhaustion trends, not every internal fluctuation. Carry request identifiers through

36
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:29,950
logs and traces. For security, authenticate the

37
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:47,450
caller, authorize the resource action, encrypt in transit and at rest, minimize sensitive data, rotate credentials, and audit

38
00:10:47,500 --> 00:11:04,950
privileged changes. Mention abuse controls when the system exposes public APIs or user-generated content. Prepare to zoom into

39
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:22,450
one write and one read at message-level detail. Name the request, validation, authoritative mutation, secondary updates, response, and

40
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:39,950
