42
00:11:57,500 --> 00:12:14,950
If a decision depends on an unknown

43
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:32,450
requirement, offer two branches and ask the interviewer which product behavior to optimize. Close by restating the requirements

44
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:49,950
that drove the design, the source of truth, the main data path, and the most important tradeoff. Offer

45
00:12:50,000 --> 00:13:07,450
