46
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:24,950
data model, consistency, capacity, failure recovery, or a product-specific edge case. The design is complete when its behavior

47
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:42,450
under pressure is as clear as its happy path. Keep the final summary short enough that the interviewer

48
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:59,950
